.TH SHAMMY 1 "September 2026" "shammy 0.9.7" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
shammy \- desktop chat client for OpenAI-compatible local backends
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B shammy
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shammy is a Qt 6 desktop chat client for Ollama, llama.cpp server,
LM Studio, vLLM, and other OpenAI-compatible /v1 backends. It streams
completions, keeps conversation history, runs local MCP tools, and
previews HTML and SVG artifacts.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/shammy/
Conversation database and application data.
.TP
.I ~/.config/shammy/shammy.conf
Qt settings.
.TP
.I ~/.shammy/config.json
MCP server configuration (Claude Desktop
.B mcpServers
schema).
.SH SEE ALSO
.UR https://github.com/TragicWarrior/shammy
.UE
